%h2 Merge Proposals

%ul
  %li Merge Target (will remain)
  %ul
    %li Title: #{@proposal.title}
    %li Description: #{@proposal.description}
    %li Proposed By: #{@proposal.submitted_by}
  %li Merge Source (will be deleted)
  %ul
    %li Title: #{@other_proposal.title}
    %li Description: #{@other_proposal.description}
    %li Proposed By: #{@other_proposal.submitted_by}

  %p
    You can make any changes to the merge target below, if desired.
  %form#proposalform{method: 'post', onsubmit: 'return validateProposal();'}
    %div.mb-3
      %label.form-label{for: 'title'} BoF Title:
      %input.form-control#title{name: 'title', value: @proposal.title}
    %div.mb-3
      %label.form-label{for: 'description'} BoF Description:
      %input.form-control#description{name: 'description', value: @proposal.description}
    %ul
      This process will:
      %li Modify the fields for the Merge Target (if desired, above)
      %li Add anyone interested in the Merge Source to now be interested in the Merge Target instead
      %li Add the proposer of the Merge Source to be interested in the Merge Target
      %li Notify anyone who was interested in the Merge Source about the merge (and the time of the Merge Target, if already scheduled)
      %li Notify the proposer of the Merge Source about the merge
      %li If the Merge Target is now above the Interest Threshold and wasn't before, send it out for self-scheduling
      %li Delete the Merge Source
    %input.btn.btn-primary.mb-3{type: 'submit', value: 'Merge Proposals'}

